            {
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "The YARA rule name deploy derives from the rule name is a YARA keyword or keeps a character other than an ASCII letter, digit or underscore."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "# harfanglab_yara_rule_name\n\nThe YARA rule name deploy derives from the rule name is a YARA keyword or keeps a character other than an ASCII letter, digit or underscore.\n\nReported by the analysis engine for an object file: an editor running `opentide lsp start` shows it. `opentide validate` and `opentide lint` are the authority for objects and name the same problem with their own code.\n\n## Example\n\n```text\nopentide validate\n```\n\n## How to fix\n\nChange the file where the frame points, then run `opentide validate` again.\n",
                "text": "harfanglab_yara_rule_name\n\nThe YARA rule name deploy derives from the rule name is a YARA keyword or keeps a character other than an ASCII letter, digit or underscore.\n\nReported by the analysis engine for an object file: an editor running opentide lsp start shows it. opentide validate and opentide lint are the authority for objects and name the same problem with their own code.\n\nExample\n\nopentide validate\n\nHow to fix\n\nChange the file where the frame points, then run opentide validate again."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://opentide.org/docs/cli/diagnostics#harfanglab_yara_rule_name",
              "id": "harfanglab_yara_rule_name",
              "name": "HarfanglabYaraRuleName",
