            {
              "defaultConfiguration": {
                "level": "error"
              },
              "fullDescription": {
                "text": "A YARA-L `match` window is not a duration in `m`, `h` or `d`, or is longer than its kind allows."
              },
              "help": {
                "markdown": "# yaral_match_window\n\nA YARA-L `match` window is not a duration in `m`, `h` or `d`, or is longer than its kind allows.\n\nSeverity: error. Reported by `opentide validate` (its `schema` check) on a `configurations.google_secops` block (yara-l-1.0). A hop or sliding window in a rule is 1 minute to 14 days; a tumbling window (`type: tumbling`) at most 72 hours. Seconds are not a window unit.\n\n## Example\n\n```yaml\nconfigurations:\n  google_secops:\n    match:\n      group_by: [$user]\n      window: 15d\n```\n\n## How to fix\n\nWrite a window within the bounds, such as `30m`, `12h` or `14d`.\n",
                "text": "yaral_match_window\n\nA YARA-L match window is not a duration in m, h or d, or is longer than its kind allows.\n\nSeverity: error. Reported by opentide validate (its schema check) on a configurations.google_secops block (yara-l-1.0). A hop or sliding window in a rule is 1 minute to 14 days; a tumbling window (type: tumbling) at most 72 hours. Seconds are not a window unit.\n\nExample\n\nconfigurations:\n  google_secops:\n    match:\n      group_by: [$user]\n      window: 15d\n\nHow to fix\n\nWrite a window within the bounds, such as 30m, 12h or 14d."
              },
              "helpUri": "https://opentide.org/docs/cli/diagnostics#yaral_match_window",
              "id": "yaral_match_window",
              "name": "YaralMatchWindow",
              "shortDescription": {
                "text": "A YARA-L `match` window is not a duration in `m`, `h` or `d`, or is longer than its kind allows."
              }
            },
